@startuml 08-state-auction
title Auction Lifecycle

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor    #1976D2
  ArrowColor     #455A64
}

[*] --> open : POST /auctions\nemits AuctionCreated → locks product

state open {
  open : Buyers may place bids
  open : current_best_bid updated on each BidPlaced
}

open   --> accepted  : auction-closer task\nends_at < NOW()\nemits AuctionAccepted (cid=NEW)
open   --> cancelled : seller cancels (rare)\nemits AuctionCancelled

state accepted {
  accepted : Saga in flight\nwaiting for OrderCreated
}

accepted --> closed : consumes OrderCreated\nemits AuctionClosed → unlocks product
accepted --> open   : consumes WalletDebitFailed\nor OrderCreationFailed\n(back on the market)

cancelled --> [*] : emits AuctionCancelled → unlocks product
closed    --> [*]

note right of accepted
  The "accepted" state is the saga window.
  If nothing resolves it within the timeout,
  the wallet refund task forces back to "open".
end note
@enduml
